    ----
    + HandleSetHgmExclusiveScreen(pid : pid_t, screenId : ScreenId) : bool
}

note right of HgmFrameRateManager::HandleSetHgmExclusiveScreen
  <b>函数体逻辑</b>:
  1. screenId != INVALID_SCREEN_ID:
     - HgmCore::Instance().GetScreen(screenId) 取 HgmScreen
     - 校验 screen 存在且 GetSelfOwnedScreenFlag() 为 true，否则返回 false
     - cleanPidCallback_[pid].insert(HGM_EXCLUSIVE_SCREEN)
  2. screenId == INVALID_SCREEN_ID:
     - cleanPidCallback_[pid].erase(HGM_EXCLUSIVE_SCREEN)
  3. hgmExclusiveScreenId_.store(screenId); 返回 true

  <b>本函数直接访问的成员</b>:
  - 成员变量: hgmExclusiveScreenId_, cleanPidCallback_
  - 成员函数: 无 (仅本函数自身)

  <b>引用的外部符号</b>:
  - 常量: INVALID_SCREEN_ID
  - 枚举值: CleanPidCallbackType::HGM_EXCLUSIVE_SCREEN
  - 静态: HgmCore::Instance()
  - 方法: HgmCore::GetScreen(), HgmScreen::GetSelfOwnedScreenFlag()
end note

